  DesignerSolution: "Luy\u1EC7n: hi\u1EC3u li\xEAn k\u1EBFt kh\xF4ng gian v\xE0 ch\u1ECDn
    l\u1ED1i quay v\u1EC1 s\xE2n g\u1EA7n nh\u1EA5t sau khi \u0111i qu\xE1. B\u1ED1
    tr\xED: P11 + P12 \u2014 ba v\xF9ng kh\xF4ng gian ng\u1EAFn c\xF3 m\u1ED9t \u0111\u01B0\u1EDDng
    n\u1ED1i v\xF2ng, m\u1ED7i v\xF9ng \u0111\u1ECDc \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c t\u1EEB
    s\xE2n v\xE0o.\nRecovery: \u0110\u01B0\u1EDDng v\xF2ng \u0111\u01B0\u1EE3c nh\xECn
    th\u1EA5y v\xE0 c\xF3 collider th\u1EADt; kh\xF4ng \xE9p ch\u1EA1y l\u1EA1i to\xE0n
    m\u1EA1ng khi sai m\u1ED9t ng\xE3"
